# SBV2 v2 real-checkpoint parity fixtures (Task 28 real parity + Task 34
# fixture management, SBV2 v2 plan `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-
# sbv2-v2-design.md` §10). The real checkpoints are large and licensed
# under their own upstream terms (AGPL-3.0 / cc-by-sa-4.0 / MIT — never
# Apache-2.0), so only the sha256 placeholders, the manifest template, and
# the owner recipe (tests/fixtures/sbv2/README.md) are committed; the
# actual .gguf / .safetensors weights and the Task 30 reference dump are
# produced locally and never fabricated by CI.
tests/fixtures/sbv2/*.gguf
tests/fixtures/sbv2/*.safetensors
tests/fixtures/sbv2/reference_dump/

# Spurious duplicates: sbv2_dump_reference.py が uv-managed で CWD=tools/parity
# の状態で走ると `tests/fixtures/sbv2/...` を tools/parity 起点の相対パスに
# 書いてしまうことがある (canonical は repo-root/tests/fixtures/sbv2/、
# tools/parity 直下の tests/ ツリーは副産物)。fixtures と reference_dump
# 双方が同 pattern で発生し得るのでディレクトリ丸ごと無視する。
tools/parity/tests/

